        <p><strong>Location:</strong> Tofo and Pomene, Mozambique.</p>
        <p><strong>Period working with MMF:</strong> 2018–2019, in Mozambique and remotely.</p>
        <p><strong>My role:</strong> research assistance, communications design, and fundraising.</p>
        <p>I supported the Marine Megafauna Foundation’s research, communications, and fundraising, working in Mozambique and remotely.</p>
        <h2>Research in the field</h2>
        <p>During scuba and freediving surveys, I recorded field notes and photographed manta rays and whale sharks for identification. The media below documents manta fieldwork in Pomene, November 2018.</p>
