        <h2>Supporting the organization</h2>
        <p>My communications work included outreach, grant writing, and sponsorship programs alongside research support.</p>
        <h3>Manta sponsorship</h3>
        <p>MMF’s manual manta-adoption process was difficult to scale. With researchers, I developed sponsorship stories around four mantas, then connected WordPress, WooCommerce, and Printful to automate purchases and worldwide merchandise fulfillment without holding inventory.</p>
        <h2>Dive the Data</h2>
        <p>With Zouhair Mahboubi, I designed Dive the Data during my MMF engagement. Linked views of location, frequency, and time helped dive centers explore sightings they collected for research.</p>
        <p>We simplified collection with dive-center whiteboards and matching Google Sheets. The project reached five regions globally.</p>
        <p><a href="../projects/dive-the-data.html">Explore Dive the Data</a>.</p>
